### Phase 2: Real-time AI Predictive Route Name (Future)

Instead of waiting for a trip to complete (12 hours) to name a route, the `RouteProgressEngine` will identify if a bus's live GPS traversal has an 80% match with a previously learned route in our database. If so, it will dynamically overwrite the "Dynamic Route" name with the predicted route name on the fly.
*(To be detailed and implemented in a follow-up iteration)*

### Phase 3: Smart Journey Search Graph Engine (Future - User App)

When building the User App, instead of string matching:
1. The user selects Source (A) and Destination (B).
2. `graphEngine.ts` computes the path sequence (A -> C -> B).
3. The backend scans the live GPS coordinates of all 9699 active buses.
4. Buses physically located within a 5km radius of the route path, with a directional `heading` towards B, are shown to the user in real-time.
*(To be detailed and implemented during the User App development phase)*

